[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 61 \u001b[22m | Delivery | Manifest task (stage) | Exit criterion |\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22m--- | --- | --- |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 63 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| Station traffic lanes | after W21 (the user's, 2026-11-22) | Departures, arrivals and cruises between\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m stations kept off one another's lines: Manifest's policies, choosing per hour, fly between the five st\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mations of Ore's one orbit, whose ships leave, arrive and cruise along the same chords. Each station's d\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mepartures leave by gates on one side and its arrivals come in by gates on another, several of each, ass\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242migned as the pads are, as an airport's departure and arrival routes are; and a cruise's way and its end\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ms offset by its direction, as aviation's levels by heading and Freelancer's paired one-way trade lanes \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mdo, so opposite flows never share a line. With [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe way in to a pad\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](#then-robustness-tools-and-what-a-\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mmod-can-reach)'s corridor. Measured by ships flown both ways between neighbouring stations of one orbit\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m, none within a hull's clearance of another, and no departure or arrival slower than today's. |        \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 64 \u001b[22m |\u001b[13GEncryp\u001b[20Gion | before Manifes