[0.048, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtender contract\u001b[39m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#tender-contract-w11-2026-11-21), its AI issuer spending\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m `Trade::Budget` and calling `Trade::Reliefs`. A commit is gated in\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[11G\u001b[22mthe second checkout, `build/gate-tree`, wi\u001b[54Gh `--tidy`, editing alone beside it\u001b[90G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/proj\u001b[18Gts/manifest/docs/session-handoff.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m `T\u001b[14Gad\u001b[17G::Budget` and calling `Trade::Reliefs`.\u001b[57GA\u001b[59Gcommit\u001b[66Gis\u001b[69Ggated\u001b[75Gin\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m the second checkout, `build/gate-tree`,\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56G`--tidy`,\u001b[66Gediting\u001b[74Galone\u001b[80Gbeside\u001b[87Git\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mgating beside the work\u001b[39m](build-and-gates.md#gating-bes\u001b[67Gde-th\u001b[73G-work)).\u001b[82GA\u001b[84Gship\u001b[89Gsteered\u001b[97Gin\u001b[100Ga\u001b[102Gstation's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 18 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mframe still runs every step, which is most of the zero-client run's steps\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m.\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 18 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mframe still runs every step, which is most of the zero-client run's steps\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m, more so since per hour\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 19 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe policies hop between the stations of Ore's one orbit. Jettison's station traffic lanes follow      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m20\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mW21 (the use\u001b[24G's,\u001b[28G2026-11-22).     \u001b[46G  \u001b[49G    \u001b[54G  \u001b[57G   \u001b[61G           \u001b[73G     \u001b[79G                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 21 \u001b[22m The planning documents' home-region allocation (scope, the roadmap's region supply and D-076) waits\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 22 \u001b[22m for W13 to restate it as founding.\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCommitting\u001b[14Gslice\u001b[20G4\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Ggating\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gchunk\u001b[43G(pin\u001b[48Gcommit\u001b[55Gplus\u001b[60Gslice\u001b[66G4)\u001b[69Gin\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gsecond\u001b[83Gcheckout:\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
