01b[97Gdemand for\u001b[108Gcopp\u001b[114G is\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gshallow. So the test puts the rest of the copper\u001b[54Gin the\u001b[61Ghold direct\u001b[73Gy;\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[81Golicy still picks\u001b[99Gthe lot and\u001b[111Gth\u001b[114G thrust\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bitself.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNext is slice\u001b[17G6, th\u001b[23G W21 close-out: r\u001b[41Gadmap\u001b[47Gand history rows an\u001b[67G the stage review. It's documentation only,\u001b[111Gso this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsession can\u001b[15Gcarry\u001b[21Gon;\u001b[25G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[34G\u001b[39mfirst\u001b[40Gwould\u001b[46Galso\u001b[51Gbe\u001b[54Gfine.\u001b[60GI\u001b[62Ghaven't\u001b[70Gchecked\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82GGitHub\u001b[89GActions\u001b[97Grun\u001b[101Gfor\u001b[105G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249md2ff6b9\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 30m 43s · done 5:54 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe're finishing W21, fuel burn, in Manifest; slice 5, the manned-drive fixture test, is done, passed the gate \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mand is pushed as d2ff6b9. Next is slice 6, the documentation close-out, once you say go. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
