[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3GNext is Je\u001b[14Gtison's station traffic\u001b[38Glanes,\u001b[45Gwhich\u001b[51Gis\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gdesign-heavy\u001b[69Gengine\u001b[76Gtask.\u001b[82GI'd\u001b[86Gstart\u001b[92Git\u001b[95Gin\u001b[98Ga\u001b[100Gfresh\u001b[106Gsession\u001b[114Grather\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthan \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m, since none of this session's context carries over to\u001b[71Gi\u001b[73G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 43s · done 6:07 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAdjust yourself so you always stage the files by name to avoid tripping that hook again.\u001b[39m                              \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRecalled \u001b[1m2\u001b[14G\u001b[22mmemories, wrote \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m me\u001b[35Gories \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m From now on I'll stage every commit by naming its files, as in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit add docs/a.md source/b.cpp\u001b[39m. I won't use \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m-A\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--all\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.\u001b[5G\u001b[39mor\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m-u\u001b[39m,\u001b[12Gincluding\u001b[22Gwith\u001b[27Ga\u001b[29Gpath\u001b[34Gafter\u001b[40Gthem\u001b[45Glike\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit add -A docs\u001b[39m,\u001b[67Gwhich\u001b[73Gis\u001b[76Gwhat\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Ghook\u001b[90Gblocked.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gsaved\u001b[11Gthis\u001b[16Gas\u001b[19Ga\u001b[21Gnew\u001b[25Gmemory,\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mstage-files-by-name.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[57Gand\u001b[61Gadded\u001b[67Git\u001b[70Gto\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gmemory\u001b[84Gindex,\u001b[91Gso\u001b[94Git's\u001b[99Gloaded\u001b[106Gat\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gstart\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[1B \u00