[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[8B←  ☒ Lane shape \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Lane choice \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mis a shi\u001b[14G given\u001b[21Gone of the sever\u001b[38Gl l\u001b[42Gnes e\u001b[48Gch way?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mH\u001b[8Gld\u001b[11Gl\u001b[13Gke pads (Recommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA station'\u001b[17G departur\u001b[27G gates are saved state, given in comm\u001b[65Gnd order. A ship\u001b[82Gle\u001b[85Gving\u001b[90Gits\u001b[94Gpad get\u001b[103Gthe lowest lane \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwhose gate is free and on which it would overtake n\u001b[58G ship \u001b[66Gr\u001b[68Gady cruising the\u001b[85Gsame way (cruise times are known in \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Badvance). It keeps that l\u001b[33Ge\u001b[36Gll the way to the far station's\u001b[68Ggate on th\u001b[80Gs\u001b[82Gme lane. Determinist\u001b[103Gc and saved, but \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bit adds a component an\u001b[30Gchanges\u001b[38Ghow Manifes\u001b[50G and th\u001b[58G sample \u001b[67Gtart a depar\u001b[80Gure.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BWorked\u001b[13Gout on the\u001b[24Gspot\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mNothing saved: as a ship leaves, th\u001b[42G lane \u001b[49Gs picked from where the other ships are and where they are flying.\u001b[116G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSmaller API change, but two ships leaving in\u001b[51Gthe same st\u001b[63Gp\u001b[65Gcan p\u001b[71Gck the\u001b[78Gsame lane unless the tie is broken by \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mentity order, \u001b[21Gnd a\u001b[26Gload has to\u001b[38Ggive the sam\u001b[51G answer.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
[30.428, "o", "\u001b(B\u000f\u001b[?2004h\u001b[<u\u001b[>5u\u001b[>4;2m\u001b[?1000h\u001b[?1002h\u001b[?1003h\u001b[?1006h"]
[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[16C\u001b[8B ☒ Lane choice \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Scope \r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mThe roadma\u001b[15Grow says the\u001b[28Glane\u001b[33G come \"with the way in to a pad's corridor\" (entry 31: an approach flown without \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mstopping, speed falling with distance, the reservation lapsing on lost progress). Build both now?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mLanes first (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mLanes\u001b[12Gand gates first,\u001b[29Gwith arrivals still using today's stop-then-desce\u001b[79Gd\u001b[81Gway\u001b[85Gin from their arrival g\u001b[109Gt\u001b[111G, measured\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bs the row as\u001b[20Gs. Then \u001b[29Ghe corridor as its \u001b[49Gwn delivery straight after, f\u001b[79Gd by the arrival gate\u001b[101G. Two small\u001b[113Gr \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153ms\u001b[8Geps, e\u001b[15Gch with i\u001b[25Gs own evid\u001b[36Gnce and p\u001b[46Gn moves.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BB\u001b[8Gth toge\u001b[16Gher\u001b[20G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOne delivery: arrival gates l\u001b[36Gad\u001b[39Gstraight\u001b[49Gnto a pad's approach corrido\u001b[78G. Fewer pin moves in\u001b[99GManifest, but a much \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Blarger change to steering, the docks and the\u001b[51Glane\u001b[56G at\u001b[60Gonce.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4. Chat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u0