[0.076, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · How should opposite flows be kept apart along a cruise and at its ends? → Keep right (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is a ship given one of the several lanes each way? → Held like pads (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe\u001b[12Groadmap row says the lanes come \"with the\u001b[54Gway in to a p\u001b[68Gd's corridor\"\u001b[82G(\u001b[84Gntry 31:\u001b[93Gan approach flown without \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bstopping, speed\u001b[22Gfalling with\u001b[35Gdistanc\u001b[43G, the r\u001b[52Gervation lapsing on lost progr\u001b[83Gss). Build both now? → Lanes first \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(Recommen\u001b[16Ged)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSettled: keep right,\u001b[24Glanes\u001b[30Gheld\u001b[35Glike\u001b[40Gpads,\u001b[46Glanes\u001b[52Gfirst.\u001b[59GNext\u001b[64GI'm\u001b[68Gchecking\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gsystem's\u001b[90Gaxes,\u001b[96Gsteering's\u001b[107Gdestinations\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Gtest\u001b[16Gsystems,\u001b[25Gso\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32GAPI\u001b[36Gcan\u001b[40Gbe\u001b[43Gspecified\u001b[53Gexactly.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm writing the design into the roadmap\u001b[43Grow\u001b[47Gbefore\u001b[54Gcoding:\u001b[62Gcruises\u001b[70Guse\u001b[74Gthree\u001b[80Glanes\u001b[86Geach\u001b[91Gway,\u001b[96Gwith\u001b[101Gdepartures\u001b[112Gabove\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Borbit\u001b[9Gplane\u001b[15Gand\u001b[19Garrivals\u001b[28Gbelow,\u001b[35Gand\u001b[39G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClearOf\u001b[47G\u001b[39mis\u001b[50Gbeing\u001b[56G