[0.031, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B  1. \u001b[1mMap the engine/space coupling (my recommendation).\u001b[22m You want it undone soon, so I'd work out where space concepts\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bleak\u001b[11Ginto\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gneutral\u001b[28Gmodules,\u001b[37Gfor\u001b[41Gexample\u001b[49Gspace\u001b[55Gterms\u001b[61Gin\u001b[64Gphysics,\u001b[73GAI\u001b[76Gsteering\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Gdocks.\u001b[96GThat\u001b[101Ggives\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Gfirst\u001b[115Gdraft\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   of a decoupli\u001b[20Gg plan to set\u001b[34Gle with you.\u001b[47GIt's read-only, so it's\u001b[71Gsafe bes\u001b[80Gde\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Ggate.\u001b[93G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2. \u001b[1mPrepare W12\u001b[22m (competitive procu\u001b[38Gment), which\u001b[51Gis\u001b[54Gnext\u001b[59Gin\u001b[62GManifest:\u001b[72Gre-read\u001b[80Gits\u001b[84Gtender\u001b[91Gcontract\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gslices,\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Glist\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwhat's\u001b[13Gstill\u001b[19Gto\u001b[22Gsettle\u001b[29Gwith\u001b[34Gyou.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mCommit the Jettison docs now:\u001b[22m the parked lanes entry, with your reason added. That's a d\u001b[95Gcs-only commit\u001b[110Gand can go\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bin straigh\u001b[17G away; the\u001b[28GManif\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gc\u001b[39Gmmit waits for th\u001b[57G gate.\u001b[64G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhich one, or more than on\u001b[30G? I'll report the gate result when \u001b[66Gt finishes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 32m 59s · done 6:45 pm\u001b[40G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m1 and 3.\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gcd\u001b[14G'/home/ivan/projects/manifest/build/gate-tree'…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/h\u001b[15Gme/ivan/projects/manifest/build/gate-tree' && CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BMANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS=24 ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --tidy > \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'/home/ivan/projects/manifest'/build/gate-traffic.out 2>&1 (11m 59s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[37C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 2s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
