[0.036, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Greading\u001b[11Gand\u001b[15Gplanning\u001b[24Gare\u001b[28Gsafe.\u001b[34GThree\u001b[40Goptions:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mMap the engine/space coupling (my recommendation).\u001b[22m You\u001b[61Gwant it undone\u001b[77Goon, so\u001b[85GI'\u001b[89Gw\u001b[91Gr\u001b[93G out where space concepts\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bleak\u001b[11Gint\u001b[15G the neutral modules,\u001b[37Gfor example spac\u001b[54G terms in physics, AI\u001b[76Gsteering and docks.\u001b[96GThat\u001b[101Ggives\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Gfirst\u001b[115Gdraft\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gof a decoupling \u001b[23Glan to settle with you. It's read-only, so it's safe beside th\u001b[86G gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mPrepare W12\u001b[22m (c\u001b[21Gmp\u001b[25Gitive procurement),\u001b[45Gwhich\u001b[51Gis\u001b[54Gnext\u001b[59Gin\u001b[62GManifest:\u001b[72Gre-read\u001b[80Gits\u001b[84Gtender\u001b[91Gcontract\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gslices,\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Glist\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gwhat's still to settle with you.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mCommit the Jettison docs now:\u001b[22m the parked lanes entry, with\u001b[65Gyour\u001b[70Greason\u001b[77Gadded.\u001b[84GThat's\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gdocs-only\u001b[103Gcommit\u001b[110Gand\u001b[114Gcan\u001b[118Ggo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[9Gstraight\u001b[18Gaway;\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28GManifest\u001b[37Gcommit\u001b[44Gwaits\u001b[50Gfor\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Ggate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhich\u001b[9Gone,\u001b[14Gor\u001b[17Gmore\u001b[22Gthan\u001b[27Gone?\u001b[32GI'll\u001b[37Greport\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Ggate\u001b[53Gresult\u001b[60Gwhen\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gfinishes.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 32m 59s · done 6:45 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m1