[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mMap the engine/space coupling (my recommendation).\u001b[57G\u001b[22mYou\u001b[61Gwant\u001b[66Git\u001b[69Gundone\u001b[76Gsoon,\u001b[82Gso\u001b[85GI'd\u001b[89Gwork\u001b[94Gout\u001b[98Gwhere\u001b[104Gspace\u001b[110Gconcepts\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bleak\u001b[11Ginto\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gneutral\u001b[28Gmodules,\u001b[37Gfor\u001b[41Gexample\u001b[49Gspace\u001b[55Gterms\u001b[61Gin\u001b[64Gphysics,\u001b[73GAI\u001b[76Gsteering\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Gdocks.\u001b[96GThat\u001b[101Ggives\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Gfirst\u001b[115Gdraft\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gof a decoupling plan to settle with you. It's read-only, so\u001b[68G's saf\u001b[76Gbeside the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mPrepare W12\u001b[22m (competitive procurement), which is next in Manifest: re-read its te\u001b[88Ger \u001b[92Gontract and slices, and lis\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwhat's stil\u001b[18G to\u001b[22Gsettle with you.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mCommit the Jettison docs now:\u001b[22m the parked lanes e\u001b[55Gtry, with your reason \u001b[79Gded.\u001b[84GThat's\u001b[91Ga docs-only commit and can go\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bin straight away; \u001b[25Ghe Manifest commit\u001b[44Gwaits\u001b[50Gfor\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Ggate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhich\u001b[9Gone, or more than one? I'll\u001b[37Grepor\u001b[44Gthe gate result when\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gfinishes.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 32m 59s · done 6:45 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m1 and 3.\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m Running cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest/build/gate-tree'…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manif