[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat happens to Jettison's space sample, the engine's automated-test consumer for all of this?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B1. \u001b[1mIt keeps a small\u001b[23Gcopy\u001b[28Gof the space code it uses.\u001b[55G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[59Gduplication\u001b[71Gis\u001b[74Gminimal:\u001b[83Gorbits\u001b[90Gon\u001b[93Grails\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105Gsimple\u001b[112Gcruise.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt shrinks to the neutral capabilities\u001b[22m,\u001b[46Gexercised\u001b[56Gby\u001b[59Ga\u001b[61Gnon-space\u001b[71Gtest\u001b[76Ggame\u001b[81Gor\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mground\u001b[95G\u001b[39mand\u001b[99G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjetsam\u001b[106G\u001b[39msamples,\u001b[115Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[7Ghe s\u001b[12Gace-specific code\u001b[30Gis t\u001b[35Gsted only in\u001b[48GMan\u001b[52Gf\u001b[54Gst.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe space code moves into an optional extension package in Jettison\u001b[22m,\u001b[75Goutside\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gcore\u001b[92Gengine.\u001b[100GManifest\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gsample both use it, so nothing is duplicated, but it\u001b[59Gisn't \"into\u001b[71GManifest\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'd choose option 2. It's the\u001b[33Gcleanest boundary and matches\u001b[63Gyour\u001b[68Grule.\u001b[74GIts\u001b[78Gcost\u001b[83Gis\u001b[86Gthat\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gspace\u001b[101Gsample\u001b[108Gloses\u001b[114Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcruises and jumps, unless the sample is rebuilt on the neutral transit and portal capabilities.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gline\u001b[12Gcounts\u001b[19Gcome\u001b[24Gfrom\u001b[29Gfile\u001b[34Gtotals,\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Ginventory\u001b[60Gagent's\u001b[68Gsplit\u001b[74Gestimates\u001b[84Gare\u001b[88Grough.\u001b[95GI\u001b[97Ghaven't\u001b[105Gc