[0.077, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mIt keeps a small copy of the space code it uses.\u001b[22m The duplication is minimal: orbits on rails\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105Gsimple\u001b[112Gcruise.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt shrinks to the neutral capabilities\u001b[22m,\u001b[46Gexercised\u001b[56Gby\u001b[59Ga\u001b[61Gnon-space\u001b[71Gtest\u001b[76Ggame\u001b[81Gor\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mground\u001b[95G\u001b[39mand\u001b[99G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjetsam\u001b[106G\u001b[39msamples,\u001b[115Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gthe space-specific code is tested only in Manifest.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe space code moves into\u001b[32Gan optional extension package in Jettison\u001b[22m, outside the core engi\u001b[97Ge. Manife\u001b[107Gt and the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsample both use \u001b[23Gt, so nothing is\u001b[40Gduplicated, but it\u001b[59Gisn't\u001b[65G\"into\u001b[71GManifest\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'd choose \u001b[15Gption 2. It's\u001b[29Gthe cleanest boundary and ma\u001b[58Gches your rule. Its cost\u001b[83Gis\u001b[86Gthat\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gspace\u001b[101Gsample\u001b[108Gloses\u001b[114Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcruises\u001b[11Gand\u001b[15Gjumps,\u001b[22Gunless\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gsample\u001b[40Gis\u001b[43Grebuilt\u001b[51Gon\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gneutral\u001b[66Gtransit\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gportal\u001b[85Gcapabilities.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe line counts come from\u001b[29Gfile totals, and the inventory agent's spl\u001b[74Gestimates are rough. I haven't\u001b[105Gchecked\u001b[113Ghow\u001b[117Gfar\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BManifest's\u001b[14Gcode\u001b[19Gdepends\u001b[27Gon\u001b[30G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcelestial\u001b[40G\u001b[39mbeyond\u001b[47Gtravel\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58Gdocking.\u001b[67GThe\u001b[71Grenames\u001b[79Gchange\u001b[86Gsaved\u001b[92Gtype\u001b[97Gnames,\u001b[104Gso\u001b[107Gevery\u001b[113Gpinned\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhash \u001b[10G both repos moves,\u001b[29Gand the work\u001b[42Gneeds migrations.\u001b[60G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 1m 2s · done 6:57 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m2, and write the decoupling plan\u001b[39m                                                                                      \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m Working…\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
