 mid-way, and come\u001b[30Gout \u001b[35Gomewhere cle\u001b[48Gr.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mM\u001b[7Gtion profiles:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mtoday's cruise\u001b[37Gprofiles\u001b[46G(accelerate,\u001b[59Gcoast,\u001b[66Gdecelerate).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPor\u001b[9Gals:\u001b[22m today's\u001b[22Gjump lanes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSlots:\u001b[22m the queue\u001b[22Gan\u001b[25G re\u001b[29Gervations behind\u001b[46Gtoday's\u001b[54Ggates\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gpads.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTrigger volumes:\u001b[22m today's\u001b[30Ggate\u001b[35Grings.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBerths:\u001b[22m today's docks.      \u001b[34G         \u001b[44G   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
