 test all space game related code. \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mManifest is where future work will\u001b[38Gbuild towards a fully featured\u001b[69Ggame that is able to be modded by play\u001b[108Grs.\u001b[39m         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                            \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mYou may fold the small test sample into other text fixtures if that is suitable and reduce the amount of surface area\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexposed. Keep it\u001b[20Gif it\u001b[26Gstill provides high valu\u001b[51G \u001b[53Gest e.g. frame captures, or testing that\u001b[94Gis not possible or \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mavailable \u001b[14Glsewhere.\u001b[39m                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────── 1 new message ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                              \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
