[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[2m97\u001b[12G\u001b[22msearch, courses round spheres (`ai/Courses.h`)\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gsteering.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m98\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 199 \u001b[22m The rule that matters most: **`sim`, `celestial`, `spatial`, `physics`, `space`, `ai` and `dock` never\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/space-extraction-plan.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m lines, removed\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 105 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m1.\u001b[15G**The\u001b[21Gcheck\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Gwords.**\u001b[44GThe\u001b[48Gvocabulary\u001b[59Gcheck,\u001b[66Gwith\u001b[71Gtoday's\u001b[79Guses\u001b[84Gas\u001b[87Gits\u001b[91Gallow-list;\u001b[103Gneutral\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 106 \u001b[22m    names in neutral modul\u001b[38Gs' C++ and comments:\u001b[59Gper-frame\u001b[69Gindices\u001b[77G(`FrameIndices`),\u001b[95Grails\u001b[101Gand\u001b[105Gframes\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 107 \u001b[22m  \u001b[14G described\u001b[25Gas\u001b[28Gany\u001b[32Ggame's,\u001b[40Gsteering's\u001b[51Gvocabulary\u001b[62G(`byShape`,\u001b[74G`ShapeLimited`).\u001b[91GNames\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Gare\u001b[106Gany\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 108 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   vehicle's (flight, thrusters, a helm) and geometry's convex hull stay. Every pin held.             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 108 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   vehicle's (flight, thrusters, a helm) and geometry's convex hull stay. Every pin held.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m **Done**\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 109 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   2026-11-22: `neutral_words`, the list from 184 entries to 66, each left for the slice that removes \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 110 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   it (the dock's 38 for slice 5).                                                                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 111 \u001b[22m 2. **The sample folded and retired.** Its kept tests in their new homes, render_test on the static\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 112 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mscenes,\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gsmoke\u001b[33Grun's\u001b[39Gneutral\u001b[47Gstages,\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Greference\u001b[69Gframes\u001b[76Gheld\u001b[81Gor\u001b[84Gre-baselined\u001b[97Gonce;\u001b[103Gthen\u001b[108Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 113 \u001b[22m \u001b[13G  sample, jetsam, `spacescen\u001b[42G`\u001b[44Gand the\u001b[52Gcargo de\u001b[61Gk deleted;\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Glanes'\u001b[83Gand\u001b[87Ggates'\u001b[94Gsuites\u001b[101Gon\u001b[104Gtwo\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  cmake/neutral-wo\u001b[23Gds.txt\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mDoing…\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
