[0.860, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAt what point do you advise we update the text name in the save files e.g. \"byHull\"\u001b[39m                                   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm\u001b[7Gdeferring\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gsaved-name\u001b[32Grenames\u001b[40Gto\u001b[43Gone\u001b[47Gslice\u001b[53Gafter\u001b[59Gslice\u001b[65G6,\u001b[68Gsince\u001b[74Gchanging\u001b[83Gnames\u001b[89Gduring\u001b[96Gslices\u001b[103G2–6\u001b[107Gwould\u001b[113Gmuddy\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gthe\u001b[7Gpin ev\u001b[14Gdence and the renam\u001b[34Gs have to land before mod\u001b[60G or player saves depend on them. Meanwhile\u001b[103GI'm\u001b[107Gadding this\u001b[119Gas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bslice 7\u001b[11Gand moving the close-out\u001b[36Gto slice 8, and Jettison's gate for slice 1 is ru\u001b[86Gning.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/space-extraction-plan.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdde\u001b[11G \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 126 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m6. **The\u001b[21Gmove.**\u001b[29G`celestial`'s\u001b[43Gorbits,\u001b[51Gbodies\u001b[58Gand\u001b[62Ggalaxy,\u001b[70G`space`'s\u001b[80Gsetting\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Groutes\u001b[103Ginto\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[12G\u001b[22m  \u001b[15GManifest's `spa\u001b[32G` modu\u001b[39Ge, reflected nam\u001b[58Gu\u001b[60Gchanged; `celestial`, `space` and `spacescene` leave\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001