[0.069, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 98 \u001b[22m   pad, cargo) outside an allow-list, which each slice shrinks and the last empties.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 126 \u001b[22m 6. **The move.** `celestial`'s orbits, bodies and galaxy, `space`'s setting and the routes into\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 127 \u001b[22m    Manifest's `space` module, reflected names unchanged; `celestial`, `space` and `spacescene` leave t\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[10G \u001b[22m he\u001b[15Gengine \u001b[23Gnd\u001b[26Gits\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m128 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m  op\u001b[18Gional l\u001b[26Gst. Manifest's suites and pin\u001b[56G he\u001b[60Gd\u001b[62Gon the new SDK pin.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 129 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m7. **Close-out.** The allow-list empty; architecture, scope, game integration and the sample docs     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 129 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m7. **Saved names.** Every saved and reflected name still in the setting's words or the old module's   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 130 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   (`\"byHull\"`, `Ai.OnLane`, `Ai.Cruising` and the rest) renamed at once: one save version and its    \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 131 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   rename table, so a save written before loads, and every pin moved once, shown to be the names      \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 132 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   alone by each hash returning with the old names put back. Before players keep saves or write       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 133 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   mods against the names (the user's, 2026-11-22).                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 134 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m8. **Close-out.** The allow-list empty; architecture, scope, game integration and the sample docs     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 135 \u001b[22m    rewritten for\u001b[29Gthe boundary\u001b[42Gas it is; Manifest's boundary as\u001b[75Gessment's status; the co\u001b[100Gsumer\u001b[106Gmatrix\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 136 \u001b[22m    (\u001b[17Ground, Manifest) run; a cross-review of the whole, as at a\u001b[76Gstag\u001b[81G's end.\u001b[89G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 137 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ tail -30 '/home/\u001b[25Gvan/pr\u001b[32Gjects/jettison'/build/gate-extraction-s1.out\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
