of today's built orbit and Vesper scenes into the scene files: decks, piers, pads and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mlights as boxes and lights; procedural\u001b[45Ghull proxi\u001b[56Gs as boxes \u001b[68Gr models. Fram\u001b[83Gs re-baseli\u001b[96Gd, \u001b[100Glos\u001b[104G to today's.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mStand-in\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA few hand-written boxes a\u001b[33Gd lights per station. Less YAML, frames look clearly different.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0014 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;1H"]
