[0.019, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m18\u001b[22m shell commands · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m2 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Surveying what slice 2 touches (render_test,\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gsmoke\u001b[58Grun,\u001b[63Greference\u001b[73Gframes,\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gsample,\u001b[93Gspacescene,\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gdock's\u001b[116Gcargo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdeck)\u001b[9Gbefore\u001b[16Gsplitting\u001b[26Git\u001b[29Ginto\u001b[34Gcommits.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m13\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←\u001b[3G ☒ Stations \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Frames \u001b[26G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mThree reference frames show sample gameplay: docked (clamps on a docked shuttle), dock-sequence (the dock cinematic) \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mand market-de (the market screen in German). What happens to them?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mKeep two\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRecommended. Drop docked (clamps are Manifest's, the animation suite covers them). Keep dock-sequence as a sequence\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bon the static orbit scene. Replace market-de with a German test document that a tiny test game in render_test \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mopens, so RmlUi drawing stays covered.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u00