[0.054, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m141 \u001b[22m \u001b[15Galone by each hash returning with the old names put\u001b[67Gback.\u001b[73GBefore players\u001b[88Gkeep saves o\u001b[102Gwrite\u001b[108G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m142 \u001b[22m \u001b[15Gmods against the names (the user's, 2026-11-22).\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 147 \u001b[22m ## Settled with the user\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 148 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 149 \u001b[22m - **Before W12** (2026-11-22).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 150 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **The static scenes baked once** (2026-11-22, slice 2): what the sample's star systems and station  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 151 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  dressing built, exported into the scene files, rather than stand-in stations; `docked` dropped,     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 152 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `dock-sequence` kept on the static scene's ship and pad, and the German UI frame on the engine's    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 153 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  own saves screen.                                                                                   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m154 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m-\u001b[14G**The\u001b[20Gcargo d\u001b[28Gck's two\u001b[37Gcomponents kept** (2026-11-22, slice 2): `Dock.Transfer` and   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m155 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[14G`Dock.Buggy` \u001b[28Gtay\u001b[32Gregistered\u001b[43Gwith no behaviour, so th\u001b[68G pins\u001b[74Gmove\u001b[79Gonce, in slice 7.             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 156 \u001b[22m - **Planetary rings stay in the renderer** (2026-11-22), the one named exception: atmosphere is\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 157 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mneutral\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Grings