[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison gate passed (351 s, recorded). Before asking to push, checking Manifest against the local Jettison checkout\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[6Ga scratch build tr\u001b[25Ge\u001b[27G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mManifest passes all 53\u001b[26Gsuites\u001b[33Gagainst\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gnew\u001b[49Gengine,\u001b[57Gpinned\u001b[64Ghashes\u001b[71Gincluded.\u001b[81GPushing\u001b[89Gis\u001b[92Goutward-facing,\u001b[108Gso\u001b[111Gasking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Push \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mSlice 2 is done in Jettison: 7 commits on feature-base, and the gate passed (351 s). Manifest fetches Jettison from \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mGitHub at its pin, so moving the pin needs those commits pushed. Manifest's edits are ready and pass all 53 suites \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1magainst the local checkout. Push and move the pin?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPush and pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mPush Jettison's feature-base, then commit in Manifest: the languages note, and the SDK pin at b690066 with its data\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Band test edits. Then run Manifest's gate at full width.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Commit, no push\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCommit both repositories locally and stop. You push and run Manifest's gate yourself.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mHold\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mLeave Manife\u001b[19Gt's edits unc\u001b[33Gmmitted for you to review first.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · ↑/↓ to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0014 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
